SERVICES PAGE PART 2 (scrolled down):
How It Works
We offer premium in-home chef services for busy households who want fresh, nutritious meals without the stress of planning, shopping, or cooking.
Your dedicated chef comes to you each week, prepares a set number of entrées tailored to your preferences, and leaves your kitchen spotless.
We know the weight that comes with planning meals, scrambling for last-minute groceries, and trying to make the “right” food decisions day after day. Our service was built to remove that mental load – so your time, energy, and focus can be spent where it matters most.
Let us handle the planning, shopping, and cooking – so you can focus on what matters most.
Accordion style steps:
	•	Submit Your Intake Form Tell us about your household, food preferences, dietary needs, and schedule, so we can match you with the right chef.
	•	Get Matched & Meet Your Chef We’ll introduce you to your private chef and schedule a brief Zoom call or in-home kitchen assessment to align on needs, kitchen setup, and service goals. We will also answer any questions you may have!
	•	Choose Your Weekly Plan Select your base plan (3–6 entrees/week) and any additional add-ons. Once confirmed, we’ll send you a simple service agreement to secure your start date.
	•	Personalized Menu Every Week Your chef will send a tailored menu each Friday, you will make your selections each Sunday, and get your invoice each Monday.
	•	Cook Day Your chef shops, cooks, labels, and stores everything in your fridge – no coordination or cleanup needed on your part.
	•	Enjoy & Provide Feedback Anytime Meals are ready when you are. You can text or email your chef any time to adjust preferences or offer feedback. We want to ensure you’re happy with your experience and will always adapt as your needs evolve.
Have additional questions? Check out our FAQ page or feel free to Contact Us! We would love to hear from you.





